shared metallic reflection checks. Actual underside capture reviewed: four
green squares, unobstructed enlarged emblem and top-edge shoulder housings.
No new lights, reflection captures or animation loop are introduced. A fresh
build passes. Historical full local qualification completes104PASS/5FAIL.
